<style>
@page Section1 {
  size: 11.0in 8.5in;
  mso-page-orientation: landscape;
  margin: 0.35in 0.5in 0.35in 0.5in;
  mso-header-margin: 0.2in;
  mso-footer-margin: 0.2in;
}
div.Section1 {
  page: Section1;
}
body {
  font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
  font-size: 9.5pt;
  line-height: 1.2;
}
table.report-table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  mso-table-layout-alt: fixed;
}
</style>
</head>
<body lang="EN-US">
<div class="Section1">

  <!-- Header -->
  <table style="width:100%;border:none;margin-bottom:4pt;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width:12%;border:none;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64," style="width:58px;height:auto;" alt="NYSC Logo">
      </td>
      <td style="width:76%;border:none;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;">
        <div style="font-size:12.5pt;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.3px;text-transform:uppercase;">NATIONAL YOUTH SERVICE CORPS NATIONAL DIRECTORATE HEADQUARTERS</div>
        <div style="font-size:11.0pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;text-transform:uppercase;margin:2pt 0;">COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENT SERVICE DEPARTMENT</div>
        <div style="font-size:10.5pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;text-transform:uppercase;">DIGITAL LITERACY COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENT SERVICE GROUP</div>
      </td>
      <td style="width:12%;border:none;text-align:right;vertical-align:middle;">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="width:100px;height:auto;" alt="DL4ALL Logo">
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <!-- Metadata -->
  <table style="width:100%;border:none;margin-bottom:6pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:9.5pt;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width:25%;border:none;">STATE: <span style="border-bottom:1pt solid black;padding:0 12pt;">CROSS RIVER</span></td>
      <td style="width:25%;border:none;text-align:center;">ZONE: <span style="border-bottom:1pt solid black;padding:0 15pt;">OGOJA</span></td>
      <td style="width:25%;border:none;text-align:center;">QUARTER: <span style="border-bottom:1pt solid black;padding:0 15pt;">2ND</span></td>
      <td style="width:25%;border:none;text-align:right;">YEAR: <span style="border-bottom:1pt solid black;padding:0 15pt;">2026</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <!-- Table -->
  <table class="report-table" style="width:100%;border:1.0pt solid windowtext;">
    <thead>
      <tr style="background:#f2f2f2;font-weight:bold;font-size:8.8pt;text-align:center;">
        <th style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 3pt;width:4.5%;">S/N</th>
        <th style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;width:11.5%;">NAME OF GROUP</th>
        <th style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 3pt;width:6.5%;">NUMBER<br>OF C/MS</th>
        <th style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;width:12.5%;">LOCATION</th>
        <th style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 3pt;width:7%;">LGA</th>
        <th style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;width:33.5%;">NATURE OF ACTIVITIES</th>
        <th style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;width:14%;">ACHIEVEMENTS</th>
        <th style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;width:10.5%;">REMARKS</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr style="mso-yfti-irow:1;page-break-inside:avoid;">
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">1.</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Digital Literacy CDS Group</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">18</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Obudu Market, Obudu</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Obudu</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 6pt;text-align:justify;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;"><b>OUTREACH:</b> The CDS members visited Obudu Market to promote digital literacy among market men and women. The focus of the outreach was communication and collaboration in the digital space. Members, known as DLCs (Digital Literacy Champions), were grouped into teams of two per team and moved from shop to shop, engaging traders in practical discussions on how digital tools can enhance their business operations. DLCs demonstrated how personal gadgets (both smartphones and feature button phones) could be used to improve communication with customers and suppliers. For traders using basic phones, DLCs provided hands-on guidance on making calls, sending text messages, and saving contacts.</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Market men and women, including commercial motorcyclists and drivers, received practical guidance on the use of mobile phones (both basic and smartphones) to maximize effective communication in business operations.</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Lots of market men and women were taught the basic use of mobile phones for effective communication.</td>
      </tr>      <tr style="mso-yfti-irow:1;page-break-inside:avoid;">
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">2.</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Digital Literacy CDS Group</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">10</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Bishiri Market, Obudu</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Obudu</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 6pt;text-align:justify;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;"><b>CAMPAIGN:</b> DLCs carried out a digital awareness campaign across Bishiri Market in Obudu, visiting various shops and business offices located along the market corridor. Traders and artisans were educated on the practical everyday use of their mobile devices, basic bookkeeping apps, and essential tips for avoiding financial fraud and mobile money scams.</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">About 20 shops were visited and successfully trained on performing basic mobile phone tasks and digital content creation for their businesses.</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Impactful though tasking due to trekking under the sun from shop to shop.</td>
      </tr>      <tr style="mso-yfti-irow:1;page-break-inside:avoid;">
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">3.</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Digital Literacy CDS Group</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">4</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Handmaid Girls College, Obudu</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 4pt;text-align:center;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Obudu</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 6pt;text-align:justify;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;"><b>SCHOOL OUTREACH:</b> DLC members engaged students of Handmaid Girls College, Hagco Obudu, in interactive sessions introducing digital tools to enhance academic productivity in the school environment. Practical, hands-on demonstrations were conducted on using educational tools and platforms including Google Search, Gemini, ChatGPT, and YouTube for research and self-paced learning.</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Students were enlightened on free digital tools available for academic excellence, with live practical demonstrations conducted for them.</td>
        <td style="border:1.0pt solid windowtext;padding:5pt 5pt;text-align:left;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;">Most of the students were enthusiastic and appreciative of the digital literacy outreach and exposure to modern digital tools.</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <!-- Signatures -->
  <table style="width:100%;border:none;margin-top:10pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:9.5pt;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width:50%;border:none;">
        SCHEDULE OFFICER: <span style="border-bottom:1pt solid black;padding:0 20pt;">OKO JOHN</span>
      </td>
      <td style="width:50%;border:none;text-align:right;">
        SIGNATURE &amp; DATE: <span style="border-bottom:1pt solid black;padding:0 20pt;">26/6/2026</span>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>



</div>
